# Atlas Core Component Design Token Specification
**Author:** Rune Hale  
**Department:** Design  
**Project:** Atlas Core  
**Produced:** D12 05:55  
**Inputs used:** Business Document (Company Document)  
## Summary

Production-ready W3C DTCG-compliant component token dictionary for Atlas Core, mapping component state, elevation, and layout metrics derived from institutional baseline parameters established in Business Document: Company Document.

## Deliverable
```
{
  "$schema": "https://design-tokens.github.io/community-group/format/",
  "$metadata": {
    "project": "Atlas Core",
    "author": "Rune Hale",
    "methodology": "data-purist-deterministic",
    "sourceCompliance": "Business Document: Company Document (utilized for interface contrast ratios, dual-mode SaaS/Face-to-Face viewport constraints, and baseline grid definitions)"
  },
  "comp": {
    "button": {
      "primary": {
        "bg": { "$value": "{sys.color.brand.primary}", "$type": "color" },
        "fg": { "$value": "{sys.color.neutral.0}", "$type": "color" },
        "padding": {
          "x": { "$value": "16px", "$type": "dimension" },
          "y": { "$value": "10px", "$type": "dimension" }
        },
        "radius": { "$value": "{sys.shape.corner.sm}", "$type": "dimension" },
        "hover": {
          "bg": { "$value": "{sys.color.brand.primary-dark}", "$type": "color" }
        },
        "focus": {
          "ringWidth": { "$value": "2px", "$type": "dimension" },
          "ringOffset": { "$value": "2px", "$type": "dimension" },
          "ringColor": { "$value": "{sys.color.brand.focus-ring}", "$type": "color" }
        }
      }
    },
    "serviceCard": {
      "f2fMode": {
        "minTouchTarget": { "$value": "48px", "$type": "dimension", "$description": "Derived from Company Document field kiosk standard" },
        "surface": { "$value": "{sys.color.surface.elevated}", "$type": "color" },
        "border": { "$value": "1px solid {sys.color.border.subtle}", "$type": "border" },
        "elevation": { "$value": "{sys.elevation.level-2}", "$type": "shadow" }
      },
      "saasMode": {
        "minTouchTarget": { "$value": "32px", "$type": "dimension" },
        "surface": { "$value": "{sys.color.surface.base}", "$type": "color" }
      }
    }
  }
}
```